    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d105-a7">

                <pb facs="0218" n="138" xml:id="pg138"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 7.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Swenson to Mr.
                            Sörensen.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Replying to yours of the 24th instant,
                    inquiring if your name has been stricken off the conscription rolls, I beg to
                    say that the ministry of justice has not yet notified the foreign office as to
                    what action has been taken in your case. As soon as I receive such notice I
                    shall advise you.</p>
                <p>Respectfully, yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S.
                    Swenson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
